1
00:00:01,492 --> 00:00:03,492
== sync, corrected by elderman ==
@elder_man

2
00:00:07,972 --> 00:00:09,702
(Sheldon:)What, why did you get
a party sub?

3
00:00:09,707 --> 00:00:11,777
People are coming over;
it looked fun.

4
00:00:11,776 --> 00:00:14,916
(Sheldon:)Well, we're only watching
Game of Thrones.

5
00:00:14,913 --> 00:00:16,313
(Sheldon:)A party sub implies
it's a party.

6
00:00:16,314 --> 00:00:20,254
(Leonard:)Your attendance implies
it's not.

7
00:00:20,251 --> 00:00:22,581
(Sheldon:)I like a party
as much as the next man,

8
00:00:22,587 --> 00:00:24,687
(Sheldon:)as long as the next man
doesn't like a party.

9
00:00:24,689 --> 00:00:27,889
(Sheldon:)Oh, by the way,
don't forget,

10
00:00:27,892 --> 00:00:30,292
(Sheldon:)tomorrow is our quarterly
Roommate Agreement meeting.

11
00:00:30,295 --> 00:00:31,725
(Leonard:)Oh, Sheldon, we don't
need a meeting

12
00:00:31,729 --> 00:00:33,129
(Leonard:)every three months.
Hmm?

13
00:00:33,131 --> 00:00:35,531
(Sheldon:)Well, it sounds like the kind of
thing one would bring up

14
00:00:35,533 --> 00:00:37,003
(Sheldon:)at a quarterly
Roommate Agreement meeting.

15
00:00:37,001 --> 00:00:39,401
(Sheldon:)Lucky for you it's tomorrow.

16
00:00:39,404 --> 00:00:40,934
(Leonard:)Oh, you know what?

17
00:00:40,939 --> 00:00:42,139
(Leonard:)I'm not going.

18
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:43,670
(Sheldon:)Well, you have to go.

19
00:00:43,675 --> 00:00:46,775
(Sheldon:)It's Penny's first time leading
the Pledge of Allegiance.

20
00:00:46,778 --> 00:00:50,078
(Leonard:)This meeting is a waste of time.

21
00:00:50,081 --> 00:00:51,351
(Leonard:)Whether we make the switch

22
00:00:51,349 --> 00:00:53,279
(Leonard:)from Post Raisin Bran
to Kellogg's Raisin Bran

23
00:00:53,284 --> 00:00:56,254
(Leonard:)should not require
parliamentary procedure.

24
00:00:56,254 --> 00:01:00,124
(Sheldon:)You realize one of them
has sugar on the raisins.

25
00:01:00,124 --> 00:01:02,924
(Leonard:)You're the only one
who eats them!

